as discounts, products, or even share them with friends, giving you the perfect tool to build stronger customer relationships and drive repeat sales.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:66:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/loyalty-press-points-and-rewards/\";}i:14;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:63:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body-webtoffee-gift-cards-for-woocommerce\";s:7:\"context\";s:26:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:36:\"webtoffee-gift-cards-for-woocommerce\";s:4:\"icon\";s:64:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/image-558.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:20:\"WebToffee Gift Cards\";s:4:\"copy\";s:244:\"Easily sell, send, and manage WooCommerce gift cards—digital or physical. Schedule deliveries, personalize with 20+ templates, offer store credits, and apply flexible usage restrictions—all seamlessly integrated into your WooCommerce store.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:70:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/webtoffee-gift-cards-for-woocommerce/\";}i:15;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:54:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body-file-upload-for-woocommerce\";s:7:\"context\";s:26:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:27:\"file-upload-for-woocommerce\";s:4:\"icon\";s:92:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Customer-Upload-Files-for-WooCommerce.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:11:\"File Upload\";s:4:\"copy\";s:202:\"Allow customers to upload files from product, cart, checkout and order detail page. Charge additional fees for uploads and restrict file upload facility by products, user roles, order statuses and more.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:61:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/file-upload-for-woocommerce/\";}i:16;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:50:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body-booking-and-appointment\";s:7:\"context\";s:26:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:23:\"booking-and-appointment\";s:4:\"icon\";s:70:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Booking-80x80-1.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:23:\"Booking and Appointment\";s:4:\"copy\";s:149:\"Simplify bookings with automated processes, dynamic pricing, and email notifications, boosting efficiency and revenue for hotels and rental services.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:57:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/booking-and-appointment/\";}i:17;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:31:\"orders-list-empty-body-printful\";s:7:\"context\";s:22:\"orders-list-empty-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:8:\"printful\";s:4:\"icon\";s:77:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Printful_Logo_icon_1-1.jpg\";s:5:\"title\";s:25:\"Printful: Print on Demand\";s:4:\"copy\";s:127:\"Sell custom embroidery and print items without inventory or upfront costs. Start or grow your ecommerce business with Printful!\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:42:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/printful/\";}i:18;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:56:\"orders-list-empty-body-conditional-shipping-and-payments\";s:7:\"context\";s:22:\"orders-list-empty-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:33:\"conditional-shipping-and-payments\";s:4:\"icon\";s:111:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/Conditional_Shipping_Payments_icon-marketplace-160x160-1.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:33:\"Conditional Shipping and Payments\";s:4:\"copy\";s:91:\"Use conditional logic to restrict the shipping and payment options available on your store.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:67:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/conditional-shipping-and-payments/\";}i:19;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:42:\"orders-list-empty-body-table-rate-shipping\";s:7:\"context\";s:22:\"orders-list-empty-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:19:\"table-rate-shipping\";s:4:\"icon\";s:101:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/07/Table_Rate_Shipping_icon-marketplace-160x160-2.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:19:\"Table Rate Shipping\";s:4:\"copy\";s:123:\"Advanced, flexible shipping. Define multiple shipping rates based on location, price, weight, shipping class or item count.\";s