arning you will teach, and in teaching you will learn.Wisdom…. comes not from age, but from education and learning.</p>			<h2>Our Exams</h2>					<h2>Exams we offers</h2>		<p>JAVA</p><p>Software Enginnering</p><p>Web Programming</p><p>Python</p>			<h2>Testimonials<br>What our students says<br></h2>							\n“ExamHive made giving online exams so simple and stress-free. I could log in easily, the interface was very clear, and I didn’t face any technical issues. It’s way better than the traditional exam setup.”\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n							<img width=\"5820\" height=\"3900\" src=\"http://localhost/ExamHive24/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/pexels-olly-3768126.jpg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														John Lisa\n																						CSE Student\n							“As a student, I found ExamHive really helpful. The quizzes and exams load fast, the layout is clean, and I felt confident using it. It definitely made online testing more comfortable.”\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n							<img width=\"5120\" height=\"3413\" src=\"http://localhost/ExamHive24/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/pexels-anastasiya-gepp-654466-1462630.jpg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														Aliana Rose\n																						CSE Student\n							“I really liked how fast and reliable ExamHive is. I didn’t have to worry about slow loading or errors during the test.”\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n							<img width=\"2000\" height=\"3000\" src=\"http://localhost/ExamHive24/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/pexels-olly-3793238.jpg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														John Doe\n																						CSE Student', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '18-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-08-30 12:49:07', '2025-08-30 12:49:07', '', 18, 'http://localhost/ExamHive24/?p=133', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
