24,1.023-.275.08-.548.091-.809.032-1.098-.249-2.26.235-2.888,1.207Zm8.618,1.533l-2.791.31-.309,2.783-.059.085-.096-.021h-.004s-3.649-3.648-3.649-3.648c.177-.24.465-.361.736-.299.592.135,1.198.113,1.803-.059.885-.253,1.633-.857,2.08-1.645l2.372,2.392c.006.05-.032.097-.083.103ZM3.949,13.899h0c.002-.008.004-.016.003-.011,0,.004-.001.008-.002.011Z\"></path></svg>				\n									<h3>\n							Powerful Program						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Our program is up to date with previlling practices					</p>\n				<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" id=\"Layer_1\" data-name=\"Layer 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m24,7v10c0,1.219-.444,2.394-1.25,3.307-.367.416-.999.453-1.411.088-.415-.366-.454-.998-.089-1.412.483-.548.75-1.252.75-1.984V7c0-1.654-1.346-3-3-3H5c-1.654,0-3,1.346-3,3v10c0,1.654,1.346,3,3,3h6c.553,0,1,.448,1,1s-.447,1-1,1h-6c-2.757,0-5-2.243-5-5V7C0,4.243,2.243,2,5,2h14c2.757,0,5,2.243,5,5Zm-18,2h12c.553,0,1-.448,1-1s-.447-1-1-1H6c-.553,0-1,.448-1,1s.447,1,1,1Zm14.5,7c0,1.255-.593,2.363-1.5,3.097v4.25c0,.623-.791.89-1.169.395l-1.331-1.743-1.331,1.743c-.378.495-1.169.228-1.169-.395v-4.25c-.907-.734-1.5-1.842-1.5-3.097,0-2.206,1.794-4,4-4s4,1.794,4,4Zm-6,0c0,1.103.897,2,2,2s2-.897,2-2-.897-2-2-2-2,.897-2,2Zm-2.5-4c0-.552-.447-1-1-1h-5c-.553,0-1,.448-1,1s.447,1,1,1h5c.553,0,1-.448,1-1Zm-6,3c-.553,0-1,.448-1,1s.447,1,1,1h3c.553,0,1-.448,1-1s-.447-1-1-1h-3Z\"></path></svg>				\n									<h3>\n							24/7 Support						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						If you have any question, you can connect with our support.					</p>\n																	<img width=\"683\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://localhost/ExamHive24/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/pexels-max-fischer-5212667.jpg\" alt=\"\" />													<p>What we do</p>			<h2>Distant Learning for creative Solution</h2>										<a href=\"http://localhost/ExamHive24/about/\">\n									Read More\n					</a>\n						<p>The more that you read, the more things you will know. The more that you learn, the more places you’ll go.In learning you will teach, and in teaching you will learn.Wisdom…. comes not from age, but from education and learning.</p>			<h2>Our Exams</h2>					<h2>Exams we offers</h2>		<p>JAVA</p><p>Software Enginnering</p><p>Web Programming</p><p>Python</p>			<h2>Testimonials<br>What our students says<br></h2>							\n							“ExamHive made giving online exams so simple and stress-free. I could log in easily, the interface was very clear, and I didn’t face any technical issues. ”\n<img role=\"img\" alt=\"⭐\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/16.0.1/svg/2b50.svg\"><img role=\"img\" alt=\"⭐\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/16.0.1/svg/2b50.svg\"><img role=\"img\" alt=\"⭐\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/16.0.1/svg/2b50.svg\"><img role=\"img\" alt=\"⭐\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/16.0.1/svg/2b50.svg\"><img role=\"img\" alt=\"⭐\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/16.0.1/svg/2b50.svg\">\n							<img width=\"5820\" height=\"3900\" src=\"http://localhost/ExamHive24/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/pexels-olly-3768126.jpg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														John Lisa\n																						CSE Student\n							“As a student, I found ExamHive really helpful. The quizzes and exams load fast, the layout is clean, and I felt confident using it. It definitely made online testing more comfortable.”\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n							<img width=\"5120\" height=\"3413\" src=\"http://localhost/ExamHive24/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/pexels-anastasiya-gepp-654466-1462630.jpg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														Aliana Rose\n																						CSE Student\n							“I really liked how fast and reliable ExamHive is. I didn’t have to worry about slow loading or errors during the test.”\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n							<img width=\"2000\" height=\"3000\" src=\"http://localhost/ExamHive24/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/pexels-olly-3793238.jpg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														John Doe\n																						CSE Student\n							<h2>Recent Posts<br></h2>					<h2>Latest Articles</h2>					<ul><li>All Posts<em></em></li></ul><section data-settings=\"{&quot;layout&quot;:&quot;fitRows&quot;,&quot;stick_last_element_to_bottom&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;columns_desktop&quot;:3,&quot;gutter_hr&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_hr_mobile&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_hr_mobile_extra&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_hr_tablet&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_hr_tablet_extra&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_hr_laptop&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_hr_widescreen&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_vr&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_vr_mobile&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_vr_mobile_extra&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_vr_tablet&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_vr_tablet_extra&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_vr_laptop&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_vr_widescreen&quot;:15,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;default&quot;,&quot;animation_duration&quot;:0.3,&quot;animation_delay&quot;:0.1,&quot;deeplinking&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;filters_linkable&quot;:&quot;no&quot;,&quot;filters_default_filter&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;filters_count&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;filters_hide_empty&quot;:&quot;no&quot;,&quot;filters_animation&quot;:&quot;default&quot;,&quot;filters_animation_duration&quot;:0.3,&quot;filters_animation_delay&quot;:0.1,&quot;pagination_type&quot;:&quot;load-more&quot;,&quot;pagination_max_pages&quot;:1,&quot;lightbox&quot;:{&quot;selector&quot;:&quot;.wpr-grid-image-wrap&quot;,&quot;iframeMaxWidth&quot;:&quot;60%&quot;,&quot;hash&quot;:false,&quot;autoplay&quot;:&quot;true&quot;,&quot;pause&quot;:5000,&quot;progressBar&quot;:&quot;true&quot;,&quot;counter&quot;:&quot;true&quot;,&quot;controls&quot;:&quot;true&quot;,&quot;getCaptionFromTitleOrAlt&quot;:&quot;true&quot;,&quot;thumbnail&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;showThumbByDefault&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;share&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;zoom&quot;:&quot;true&quot;,&quot;fullScreen&quot;:&quot;true&quot;,&quot;download&quot;:&quot;true&quot;}}\"><article><h2><a target=\"_self\"  href=\"http://localhost/ExamHive24/hello-world/\">Hello world!</a></h2>August 29, 2025/<a href=\"http://localhost/ExamHive24/hello-world/#comments\">1&nbsp;Comment</a><p>Welcome to WordPress. This is your first post. Edit or delete it, then start writing!</p><a target=\"_self\" href=\"http://localhost/ExamHive24/hello-world/\">Read More</a></article></section>', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '18-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-08-30 13:15:17', '2025-08-30 13:15:17', '', 18, 'http://localhost/ExamHive24/?p=145', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
