24,1.023-.275.08-.548.091-.809.032-1.098-.249-2.26.235-2.888,1.207Zm8.618,1.533l-2.791.31-.309,2.783-.059.085-.096-.021h-.004s-3.649-3.648-3.649-3.648c.177-.24.465-.361.736-.299.592.135,1.198.113,1.803-.059.885-.253,1.633-.857,2.08-1.645l2.372,2.392c.006.05-.032.097-.083.103ZM3.949,13.899h0c.002-.008.004-.016.003-.011,0,.004-.001.008-.002.011Z\"></path></svg>				\n									<h3>\n							Powerful Program						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Our program is up to date with previlling practices					</p>\n				<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" id=\"Layer_1\" data-name=\"Layer 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m24,7v10c0,1.219-.444,2.394-1.25,3.307-.367.416-.999.453-1.411.088-.415-.366-.454-.998-.089-1.412.483-.548.75-1.252.75-1.984V7c0-1.654-1.346-3-3-3H5c-1.654,0-3,1.346-3,3v10c0,1.654,1.346,3,3,3h6c.553,0,1,.448,1,1s-.447,1-1,1h-6c-2.757,0-5-2.243-5-5V7C0,4.243,2.243,2,5,2h14c2.757,0,5,2.243,5,5Zm-18,2h12c.553,0,1-.448,1-1s-.447-1-1-1H6c-.553,0-1,.448-1,1s.447,1,1,1Zm14.5,7c0,1.255-.593,2.363-1.5,3.097v4.25c0,.623-.791.89-1.169.395l-1.331-1.743-1.331,1.743c-.378.495-1.169.228-1.169-.395v-4.25c-.907-.734-1.5-1.842-1.5-3.097,0-2.206,1.794-4,4-4s4,1.794,4,4Zm-6,0c0,1.103.897,2,2,2s2-.897,2-2-.897-2-2-2-2,.897-2,2Zm-2.5-4c0-.552-.447-1-1-1h-5c-.553,0-1,.448-1,1s.447,1,1,1h5c.553,0,1-.448,1-1Zm-6,3c-.553,0-1,.448-1,1s.447,1,1,1h3c.553,0,1-.448,1-1s-.447-1-1-1h-3Z\"></path></svg>				\n									<h3>\n							24/7 Support						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						If you have any question, you can connect with our support.					</p>\n																	<img width=\"683\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://localhost/ExamHive24/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/pexels-max-fischer-5212667.jpg\" alt=\"\" />													<p>What we do</p>			<h2>Distant Learning for creative Solution</h2>										<a href=\"http://localhost/ExamHive24/about/\">\n									Read More\n					</a>\n						<p>The more that you read, the more things you will know. The more that you learn, the more places you’ll go.In learning you will teach, and in teaching you will learn.Wisdom…. comes not from age, but from education and learning.</p>			<h2>Our Exams</h2>					<h2>Exams we offers</h2>		<p>JAVA</p><p>Software Enginnering</p><p>Web Programming</p><p>Python</p>			<h2>Testimonials<br>What our students says<br></h2>							\n							“ExamHive made giving online exams so simple and stress-free. I could log in easily, the interface was very clear, and I didn’t face any technical issues. ”\n<img role=\"img\" alt=\"⭐\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/16.0.1/svg/2b50.svg\"><img role=\"img\" alt=\"⭐\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/16.0.1/svg/2b50.svg\"><img role=\"img\" alt=\"⭐\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/16.0.1/svg/2b50.svg\"><img role=\"img\" alt=\"⭐\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/16.0.1/svg/2b50.svg\"><img role=\"img\" alt=\"⭐\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/16.0.1/svg/2b50.svg\">\n							<img width=\"5820\" height=\"3900\" src=\"http://localhost/ExamHive24/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/pexels-olly-3768126.jpg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														John Lisa\n																						CSE Student\n							“As a student, I found ExamHive really helpful. The quizzes and exams load fast, the layout is clean, and I felt confident using it. It definitely made online testing more comfortable.”\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n							<img width=\"5120\" height=\"3413\" src=\"http://localhost/ExamHive24/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/pexels-anastasiya-gepp-654466-1462630.jpg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														Aliana Rose\n																						CSE Student\n							“I really liked how fast and reliable ExamHive is. I didn’t have to worry about slow loading or errors during the test.”\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n							<img width=\"2000\" height=\"3000\" src=\"http://localhost/ExamHive24/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/pexels-olly-3793238.jpg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														John Doe\n																						CSE Student\n							<h2>Recent Posts<br></h2>					<h2>Latest Articles</h2>					<ul><li>All Posts<em></em></li></ul><section data-settings=\"{&quot;layout&quot;:&quot;fitRows&quot;,&quot;stick_last_element_to_bottom&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;columns_desktop&quot;:3,&quot;gutter_hr&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_hr_mobile&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_hr_mobile_extra&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_hr_tablet&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_hr_tablet_extra&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_hr_laptop&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_hr_widescreen&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_vr&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_vr_mobile&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_vr_mobile_extra&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_vr_tablet&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_vr_tablet_extra&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_vr_laptop&quot;:15,&quot;gutter_vr_widescreen&quot;:15,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;default&quot;,&quot;animation_duration&quot;:0.3,&quot;animation_delay&quot;:0.1,&quot;deeplinking&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;filters_linkable&quot;:&quot;no&quot;,&quot;filters_default_filter&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;filters_count&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;filters_hide_empty&quot;:&quot;no&quot;,&quot;filters_animation&quot;:&quot;default&quot;,&quot;filters_animation_duration&quot;:0.3,&quot;filters_animation_delay&quot;:0.1,&quot;pagination_type&quot;:&quot;load-more&quot;,&quot;pagination_max_pages&quot;:1,&quot;lightbox&quot;:{&quot;selector&quot;:&quot;.wpr-grid-image-wrap&quot;,&quot;iframeMaxWidth&quot;:&quot;60%&quot;,&quot;hash&quot;:false,&quot;autoplay&quot;:&quot;true&quot;,&quot;pause&quot;:5000,&quot;progressBar&quot;:&quot;true&quot;,&quot;counter&quot;:&quot;true&quot;,&quot;controls&quot;:&quot;true&quot;,&quot;getCaptionFromTitleOrAlt&quot;:&quot;true&quot;,&quot;thumbnail&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;showThumbByDefault&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;share&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;zoom&quot;:&quot;true&quot;,&quot;fullScreen&quot;:&quot;true&quot;,&quot;download&quot;:&quot;true&quot;}}\"><article><h2><a target=\"_self\"  href=\"http://localhost/ExamHive24/hello-world/\">Hello world!</a></h2>August 29, 2025/<a href=\"http://localhost/ExamHive24/hello-world/#comments\">1&nbsp;Comment</a><p>Welcome to WordPress. This is your first post. Edit or delete it, then start writing!</p><a target=\"_self\" href=\"http://localhost/ExamHive24/hello-world/\">Read More</a></article></section>', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '18-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-08-30 13:15:18', '2025-08-30 13:15:18', '', 18, 'http://localhost/ExamHive24/?p=146', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(148, 1, '2025-08-30 13:28:08', '2025-08-30 13:28:08', '<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">An Introduction to Java Programming</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What is Java?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Java is a <strong>high-level, object-oriented programming language</strong> developed by <strong>Sun Microsystems</strong> in 1995 (now owned by Oracle). It is one of the most widely used programming languages in the world, known for its <strong>platform independence</strong>, meaning Java programs can run on different devices without modification. This is possible because of the concept <strong>“Write Once, Run Anywhere (WORA).”</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key Features of Java</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Object-Oriented</strong> – Everything in Java is represented as an object (with data and behavior).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Platform Independent</strong> – Java programs run on the <strong>Java Virtual Machine (JVM)</strong>, so the same code works on Windows, Linux, or Mac.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Simple and Secure</strong> – Java is easier to learn compared to C++ and provides strong security through features like automatic memory management and no use of explicit pointers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Robust</strong> – With automatic garbage collection, exception handling, and strong type-checking, Java programs are reliable.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Multithreading</strong> – Java allows multiple tasks to run at the same time, improving performance.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Rich API</strong> – It provides built-in libraries for networking, data structures, graphics, and much more.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Java Architecture</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you write and run a Java program, it goes through these steps:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Source Code (.java)</strong> → Written by the programmer.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Compilation</strong> → The <code>javac</code> compiler translates the code into <strong>bytecode (.class)</strong>.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Execution</strong> → The JVM interprets the bytecode and executes it on the machine.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This process ensures that the program is <strong>portable</strong> across platforms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Example Program</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here’s a simple Java program to print “Hello, World!”:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:code -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code>public class HelloWorld {\n    public static void main(String&#91;] args) {\n        System.out.println(\"Hello, World!\");\n    }\n}\n</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:code -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Explanation:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><code>public class HelloWorld</code> → Defines a class named <em>HelloWorld</em>.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><code>public static void main(String[] args)</code> → The entry point of every Java program.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><code>System.out.println(\"Hello, World!\");</code> → Prints text on the screen.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Applications of Java</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Java is used in many areas, including:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Web Applications</strong> (Spring, Hibernate frameworks)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Mobile Applications</strong> (especially Android apps)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Desktop GUI Applications</strong> (JavaFX, Swing)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Enterprise Systems</strong> (Banking, ERP solutions)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Game Development</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Cloud Computing &amp; Big Data</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Advantages of Java</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Easy to learn and widely used.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Large community support.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Cross-platform compatibility.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Reliable and secure.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conclusion</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Java has remained one of the most popular programming languages for nearly three decades. Its portability, security, and versatility make it suitable for beginners as well as professionals. Whether you’re building mobile apps, enterprise software, or cloud solutions, <strong>Java continues to be a powerful and future-proof choice.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Java and its everything', 'Java is a high-level, object-oriented programming language developed by Sun Microsystems in 1995 (now owned by Oracle). It is one of the most widely used programming languages in the world, known for its platform independence, meaning Java programs can run on different devices without modification. This is possible because of the concept “Write Once, Run Anywhere (WORA).”', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'java-and-its-everything', '', '', '2025-08-30 14:04:26', '2025-08-30 14:04:26', '', 0, 'http://localhost/ExamHive24/?p=148', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(149, 1, '2025-08-30 13:25:36', '2025-08-30 13:25:36', '', 'download', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'download', '', '', '2025-08-30 13:25:36', '2025-08-30 13:25:36', '', 148, 'http://localhost/ExamHive24/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/download.png', 0, 'attachment', 'image/png', 0),
(150, 1, '2025-08-30 13:28:08', '2025-08-30 13:28:08', '<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">An Introduction to Java Programming</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What is Java?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Java is a <strong>high-level, object-oriented programming language</strong> developed by <strong>Sun Microsystems</strong> in 1995 (now owned by Oracle). It is one of the most widely used programming languages in the world, known for its <strong>platform independence</strong>, meaning Java programs can run on different devices without modification. This is possible because of the concept <strong>“Write Once, Run Anywhere (WORA).”</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key Features of Java</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Object-Oriented</strong> – Everything in Java is represented as an object (with data and behavior).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Platform Independent</strong> – Java programs run on the <strong>Java Virtual Machine (JVM)</strong>, so the same code works on Windows, Linux, or Mac.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Simple and Secure</strong> – Java is easier to learn compared to C++ and provides strong security through features like automatic memory management and no use of explicit pointers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Robust</strong> – With automatic garbage collection, exception handling, and strong type-checking, Java programs are reliable.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Multithreading</strong> – Java allows multiple tasks to run at the same time, improving performance.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Rich API</strong> – It provides built-in libraries for networking, data structures, graphics, and much more.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Java Architecture</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you write and run a Java program, it goes through these steps:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Source Code (.java)</strong> → Written by the programmer.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Compilation</strong> → The <code>javac</code> compiler translates the code into <strong>bytecode (.class)</strong>.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Execution</strong> → The JVM interprets the bytecode and executes it on the machine.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This process ensures that the program is <strong>portable</strong> across platforms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Example Program</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here’s a simple Java program to print “Hello, World!”:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:code -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code>public class HelloWorld {\n    public static void main(String&#91;] args) {\n        System.out.println(\"Hello, World!\");\n    }\n}\n</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:code -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Explanation:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><code>public class HelloWorld</code> → Defines a class named <em>HelloWorld</em>.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><code>public static void main(String[] args)</code> → The entry point of every Java program.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><code>System.out.println(\"Hello, World!\");</code> → Prints text on the screen.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Applications of Java</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Java is used in many areas, including:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Web Applications</strong> (Spring, Hibernate frameworks)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Mobile Applications</strong> (especially Android apps)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Desktop GUI Applications</strong> (JavaFX, Swing)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Enterprise Systems</strong> (Banking, ERP solutions)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Game Development</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Cloud Computing &amp; Big Data</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Advantages of Java</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Easy to learn and widely used.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Large community support.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Cross-platform compatibility.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Reliable and secure.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conclusion</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Java has remained one of the most popular programming languages for nearly three decades. Its portability, security, and versatility make it suitable for beginners as well as professionals. Whether you’re building mobile apps, enterprise software, or cloud solutions, <strong>Java continues to be a powerful and future-proof choice.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Java and its everything', 'Java is a high-level, object-oriented programming language developed by Sun Microsystems in 1995 (now owned by Oracle). It is one of the most widely used programming languages in the world, known for its platform independence, meaning Java programs can run on different devices without modification. This is possible because of the concept “Write Once, Run Anywhere (WORA).”', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '148-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-08-30 13:28:08', '2025-08-30 13:28:08', '', 148, 'http://localhost/ExamHive24/?p=150', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(151, 1, '2025-08-30 13:52:13', '2025-08-30 13:52:13', '<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">An Introduction to Web Design</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What is Web Design?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Web design is the process of creating the <strong>look, feel, and structure</strong> of websites that people use on the internet. It focuses on how a website looks, how it works, and how easy it is for visitors to interact with. A well-designed website is not only attractive but also <strong>user-friendly, responsive, and functional</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key Elements of Web Design</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Layout</strong> – The arrangement of text, images, buttons, and sections on a page.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Color Scheme</strong> – Choosing colors that match the brand and are visually appealing.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Typography</strong> – Fonts and text styles that improve readability.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Navigation</strong> – Menus, links, and buttons that help users move around the site easily.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Graphics &amp; Media</strong> – Images, icons, videos, and animations that enhance user experience.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Responsiveness</strong> – Designing websites that adapt to different devices (mobile, tablet, desktop).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tools and Technologies in Web Design</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>HTML (Hypertext Markup Language)</strong> – The structure of a webpage.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>CSS (Cascading Style Sheets)</strong> – Controls design, colors, and layouts.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>JavaScript</strong> – Adds interactivity (like sliders, forms, or animations).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Frameworks</strong> – Such as <strong>Bootstrap, Tailwind CSS</strong> for faster design.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Design Tools</strong> – Photoshop, Figma, Adobe XD, and Canva for creating layouts and graphics.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Types of Web Design</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Static Web Design</strong> – Simple sites with fixed content.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Dynamic Web Design</strong> – Sites that change content automatically using databases.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Responsive Design</strong> – Websites that fit all screen sizes.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>E-commerce Design</strong> – Online shopping websites with products and payment systems.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Importance of Web Design</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Creates a <strong>first impression</strong> for users.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Builds <strong>trust and credibility</strong> for businesses.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Helps in <strong>SEO (Search Engine Optimization)</strong> for better Google ranking.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Enhances <strong>user experience (UX)</strong> and increases engagement.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Supports brand identity and marketing goals.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Example of a Simple Web Design Code</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:code -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\n&lt;html&gt;\n&lt;head&gt;\n    &lt;title&gt;My First Web Page&lt;/title&gt;\n    &lt;style&gt;\n        body { font-family: Arial; text-align: center; background-color: #f2f2f2; }\n        h1 { color: #333; }\n        p { color: #555; }\n        button { padding: 10px 20px; border: none; background: #007BFF; color: white; cursor: pointer; }\n        button:hover { background: #0056b3; }\n    &lt;/style&gt;\n&lt;/head&gt;\n&lt;body&gt;\n    &lt;h1&gt;Welcome to My Website&lt;/h1&gt;\n    &lt;p&gt;This is a simple example of web design.&lt;/p&gt;\n    &lt;button&gt;Click Me&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;/body&gt;\n&lt;/html&gt;\n</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:code -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conclusion</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Web design is not just about making websites beautiful—it is about creating <strong>functional, user-friendly, and responsive</strong> experiences. In today’s digital world, a well-designed website is essential for businesses, organizations, and individuals to connect with people online.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Web Design', 'Web design is the process of creating the look, feel, and structure of websites that people use on the internet. It focuses on how a website looks, how it works, and how easy it is for visitors to interact with. A well-designed website is not only attractive but also user-friendly, responsive, and functional.', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'web-design', '', '', '2025-08-30 13:52:23', '2025-08-30 13:52:23', '', 0, 'http://localhost/ExamHive24/?p=151', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(153, 1, '2025-08-30 13:51:14', '2025-08-30 13:51:14', '', 'download (10)', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'download-10', '', '', '2025-08-30 13:51:14', '2025-08-30 13:51:14', '', 151, 'http://localhost/ExamHive24/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/download-10.jpg', 0, 'attachment', 'image/jpeg', 0),
(154, 1, '2025-08-30 13:52:13', '2025-08-30 13:52:13', '<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">An Introduction to Web Design</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What is Web Design?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Web design is the process of creating the <strong>look, feel, and structure</strong> of websites that people use on the internet. It focuses on how a website looks, how it works, and how easy it is for visitors to interact with. A well-designed website is not only attractive but also <strong>user-friendly, responsive, and functional</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key Elements of Web Design</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Layout</strong> – The arrangement of text, images, buttons, and sections on a page.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Color Scheme</strong> – Choosing colors that match the brand and are visually appealing.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Typography</strong> – Fonts and text styles that improve readability.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Navigation</strong> – Menus, links, and buttons that help users move around the site easily.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Graphics &amp; Media</strong> – Images, icons, videos, and animations that enhance user experience.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Responsiveness</strong> – Designing websites that adapt to different devices (mobile, tablet, desktop).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tools and Technologies in Web Design</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>HTML (Hypertext Markup Language)</strong> – The structure of a webpage.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>CSS (Cascading Style Sheets)</strong> – Controls design, colors, and layouts.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>JavaScript</strong> – Adds interactivity (like sliders, forms, or animations).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Frameworks</strong> – Such as <strong>Bootstrap, Tailwind CSS</strong> for faster design.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Design Tools</strong> – Photoshop, Figma, Adobe XD, and Canva for creating layouts and graphics.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Types of Web Design</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Static Web Design</strong> – Simple sites with fixed content.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Dynamic Web Design</strong> – Sites that change content automatically using databases.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Responsive Design</strong> – Websites that fit all screen sizes.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>E-commerce Design</strong> – Online shopping websites with products and payment systems.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Importance of Web Design</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Creates a <strong>first impression</strong> for users.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Builds <strong>trust and credibility</strong> for businesses.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Helps in <strong>SEO (Search Engine Optimization)</strong> for better Google ranking.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Enhances <strong>user experience (UX)</strong> and increases engagement.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Supports brand identity and marketing goals.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Example of a Simple Web Design Code</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:code -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\n&lt;html&gt;\n&lt;head&gt;\n    &lt;title&gt;My First Web Page&lt;/title&gt;\n    &lt;style&gt;\n        body { font-family: Arial; text-align: center; background-color: #f2f2f2; }\n        h1 { color: #333; }\n        p { color: #555; }\n        button { padding: 10px 20px; border: none; background: #007BFF; color: white; cursor: pointer; }\n        button:hover { background: #0056b3; }\n    &lt;/style&gt;\n&lt;/head&gt;\n&lt;body&gt;\n    &lt;h1&gt;Welcome to My Website&lt;/h1&gt;\n    &lt;p&gt;This is a simple example of web design.&lt;/p&gt;\n    &lt;button&gt;Click Me&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;/body&gt;\n&lt;/html&gt;\n</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:code -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conclusion</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Web design is not just about making websites beautiful—it is about creating <strong>functional, user-friendly, and responsive</strong> experiences. In today’s digital world, a well-designed website is essential for businesses, organizations, and individuals to connect with people online.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Web Design', 'Web design is the process of creating the look, feel, and structure of websites that people use on the internet. It focuses on how a website looks, how it works, and how easy it is for visitors to interact with. A well-designed website is not only attractive but also user-friendly, responsive, and functional.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '151-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-08-30 13:52:13', '2025-08-30 13:52:13', '', 151, 'http://localhost/ExamHive24/?p=154', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
