g for creative Solution</h2>										<a href=\"http://localhost/ExamHive24/about/\">\n									Read More\n					</a>\n						<p>The more that you read, the more things you will know. The more that you learn, the more places you’ll go.In learning you will teach, and in teaching you will learn.Wisdom…. comes not from age, but from education and learning.</p>			<h2>Our Exams</h2>					<h2>Exams we offers</h2>		<p>JAVA</p><p>Software Enginnering</p><p>Web Programming</p><p>Python</p>			<h2>Testimonials<br>What our students says<br></h2>							\n							“ExamHive24 made giving online exams so simple and stress-free. I could log in easily, the interface was very clear, and I didn’t face any technical issues. ”\n<img role=\"img\" alt=\"⭐\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/16.0.1/svg/2b50.svg\"><img role=\"img\" alt=\"⭐\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/16.0.1/svg/2b50.svg\"><img role=\"img\" alt=\"⭐\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/16.0.1/svg/2b50.svg\"><img role=\"img\" alt=\"⭐\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/16.0.1/svg/2b50.svg\"><img role=\"img\" alt=\"⭐\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/16.0.1/svg/2b50.svg\">\n							<img width=\"5820\" height=\"3900\" src=\"http://localhost/ExamHive24/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/pexels-olly-3768126.jpg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														John Lisa\n																						CSE Student\n							“As a student, I found ExamHive24 really helpful. The quizzes and exams load fast, the layout is clean, and I felt confident using it. It definitely made online testing more comfortable.”\n<img role=\"img\" alt=\"⭐\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/16.0.1/svg/2b50.svg\"><img role=\"img\" alt=\"⭐\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/16.0.1/svg/2b50.svg\"><img role=\"img\" alt=\"⭐\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/16.0.1/svg/2b50.svg\"><img role=\"img\" alt=\"⭐\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/16.0.1/svg/2b50.svg\"><img role=\"img\" alt=\"⭐\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/16.