(272, 1, '2025-08-31 05:59:36', '2025-08-31 05:59:36', '<h2>About<br></h2>		<p><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"12\">ExamHive24</strong> is an online educational platform designed to enhance student learning through comprehensive study materials and engaging video content. Their mission is to empower students with the resources they need to succeed academically.</p>													<img width=\"980\" height=\"980\" src=\"http://localhost/ExamHive24/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/girl-gives-5-stars-feedback-high-customer-service-rating-positive-business-reputation-concept-vector-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" />																<h2>What we offer</h2>		<h1>Distant Learning for creative Solution</h1><p>The more that you read, the more things you will know. The more that you learn, the more places you’ll go.In learning you will teach, and in teaching you will learn.Wisdom…. comes not from age, but from education and learning.</p>			<h2>Our Team</h2>		<p>Management Team</p>			\n					<img src=\"http://localhost/ExamHive24/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/92843873_922975828121574_840820563512393728_n.jpg\" alt=\"Wasima Khanom Munira\">\n			<h3>Wasima Khanom Munira</h3>\n							ForndEnd Developer\n							<a href=\"\">\n					<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M279.14 288l14.22-92.66h-88.91v-60.13c0-25.35 12.42-50.06 52.24-50.06h40.42V6.26S260.43 0 225.36 0c-73.22 0-121.08 44.38-121.08 124.72v70.62H22.89V288h81.39v224h100.17V288z\"></path></svg>				</a>\n							<a href=\"\">\n					<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M459.37 151.716c.325 4.548.325 9.097.325 13.645 0 138.72-105.583 298.558-298.558 298.558-59.452 0-114.68-17.219-161.137-47.106 8.447.974 16.568 1.299 25.34 1.299 49.055 0 94.213-16.568 130.274-44.832-46.132-.975-84.792-31.188-98.112-72.772 6.498.974 12.995 1.624 19.818 1.624 9.421 0 18.843-1.3 27.614-3.573-48.081-9.747-84.143-51.98-84.143-102.985v-1.299c13.969 7.797 30